Crowley Hart is the majordomo of the [[People/Valerius Vane|Vane]] residence in the [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Aurideon/index|Aurideon]]. He is an elderly dwarven man in a good suit, with a braided beard, a shaved head and a monocle like the one [[People/Sir Arctos|Arctos]] carries. He calls Arctos Master Arctos, and shows the minister's guests to the reading room to wait. Despite the name he is not a [[Phenomena/Hearts|Heart]].

He let Arctos take the Quinn painting, one of the minister's favourites, judging that Vane would understand if Arctos truly needed it. Faxes for Arctos come to the house, and Crowley passes them on; one carried the address of [[People/Sbrtlby Jotes|Sbrtlby Jotes]].
